            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_dialog": "Now that you\u0027ve got the knowledge of Orthrus, a suitable twin collar for the beast, and a bone to entice it, you are as ready as you can possibly be. There is little more I can do for you in this matter, save for telling you where to best summon the beast. \\n",
